[00:00.00]Favorite Place to Be (From "The Lodge") - Sophie Simnett
[00:03.08]Written by：Jeannie Lurie/Aristeidis Archontis/Chen Neeman
[00:06.17]You know I've spent some nights
[00:07.83]Basking in the light of a million shooting stars
[00:12.42]You know I've made some hearts in an old tree bark
[00:15.65]But I've forgotten where they are
[00:18.56]I saw the river run to where the current's done
[00:22.15]It's not the same with just anyone
[00:24.78]I saw the blue moon rise with my very eyes
[00:28.36]And you weren't there and I realized
[00:31.42]That wherever you're with me
[00:35.85]Is my favorite place to be
[00:43.66]On the sunny days I can find my way
[00:46.86]Walking through our memories
[00:49.87]When the sky's all dark and the rain falls hard
[00:52.98]You know it's still alright with me
[00:56.08]'Cause when the wind blows strong I know that I belong
[00:59.52]Where you left off is where I carry on
[01:02.73]I looked up and to my surprise
[01:05.92]You were there and I realized
[01:08.84]That wherever you're with me
[01:13.27]It's my favorite place to be
[01:18.32]All we need
[01:21.03]Is the air we breathe
[01:24.46]The big blue sky above
[01:26.86]The ground beneath our feet
[01:30.70]All we need
[01:33.42]Is to never leave
[01:36.88]'Cause me and you and you and me
[01:40.08]My favorite place to be
[01:42.96]You know I spent some nights
[01:44.53]Basking in the light of a million shooting stars
[01:49.11]They could all go out but when you come around
[01:52.39]We're so shining in the dark
[01:55.34]'Cause we might be right and we might be wrong
[01:58.81]All I know is that you belong
[02:01.84]I looked up and to my surprise
[02:04.98]You were there and I realized
[02:08.01]That wherever you're with me
[02:12.43]Is my favorite place to be
